---
import "../../styles/fern-and-field.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="description" content="A fictional garden-care studio design demo, made for a little more green in everyday life." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f1e8" />
    <title>Fern &amp; Field — A little care for growing things</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="demo-banner" role="region" aria-label="Fictional business notice">Fictional business <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> design demo only</div>

    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/demos/fern-and-field/">
        <svg class="wordmark-mark" viewBox="0 0 36 36" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M18 31V15m0 7c-7 0-11-4-11-11 7 0 11 4 11 11Zm0-5c0-7 4-11 11-11 0 7-4 11-11 11Z" />
          <path d="M9 30h18" />
        </svg>
        <span>fern <i>&amp;</i> field</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#care">Our care</a>
        <a href="#approach">How it grows</a>
        <a href="#questions">Questions</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="header-link" href="/work/fern-and-field/">View the project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> Thoughtful garden care</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">A little care.<br /><em>A greener</em> everyday.</h1>
          <p class="hero-intro">A garden doesn’t need to be grand to make a difference. We tend the growing things, so you can enjoy the feeling of being outside.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-dark" href="#care">Explore our care <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
            <span class="quiet-note">Gentle hands. Growing seasons.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="art-caption art-caption-top">ROOM TO ROOT</div>
          <svg class="garden-illustration" viewBox="0 0 700 690" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <defs>
              <clipPath id="art-window"><path d="M74 66h552v540H74z" /></clipPath>
              <linearGradient id="sky" x1="350" y1="66" x2="350" y2="606" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#E8E6D5"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#D3DDC9"/></linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <path d="M74 66h552v540H74z" fill="url(#sky)" />
            <g clip-path="url(#art-window)">
              <circle cx="498" cy="182" r="74" fill="#D3A86D" opacity=".8" />
              <path d="M74 425c93-62 143-26 228-76 74-44 148-32 324 44v213H74V425Z" fill="#8A9E76" />
              <path d="M74 492c126-66 207-39 301-70 90-29 170 2 251 49v135H74V492Z" fill="#627957" />
              <path d="M74 565c114-32 210-20 298-43 102-27 182 15 254 41v43H74v-41Z" fill="#3C5844" />
              <path d="M74 606h552" stroke="#293D31" stroke-width="4" />
              <path d="M186 606c12-105 18-195 12-290m5 156c-34-33-50-66-52-106m57 48c35-24 51-53 58-87m-64 168c-30-20-42-39-49-69" stroke="#354E3C" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <path d="M202 432c-36-5-55-28-51-66 37 4 57 27 51 66Zm8-55c-10-37 3-65 39-82 11 36-2 65-39 82Zm-10 103c-35-4-53-25-53-59 36 1 56 21 53 59Z" fill="#718D67" />
              <path d="M444 608c-8-133-9-207 4-310m-3 183c36-26 54-59 57-96m-60 43c-38-24-56-52-62-88m67 185c33-22 49-47 53-78" stroke="#314B3A" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <path d="M448 436c34-6 54-28 53-63-36 3-56 24-53 63Zm-8-58c13-35 2-64-32-84-14 35-3 64 32 84Zm12 105c33-7 50-28 47-61-35 4-53 24-47 61Zm-11-179c4-32 24-50 56-51-1 34-20 53-56 51Z" fill="#809571" />
              <path d="M319 606c-8-104-3-166 2-222m-1 120c-31-20-45-45-46-75m48 35c30-22 42-48 44-78" stroke="#79644D" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <path d="M320 458c-31-3-48-21-49-51 32 1 49 19 49 51Zm1-32c7-30 26-45 56-43-4 31-23 46-56 43Z" fill="#9B8B65" />
              <path d="M265 607c-24-42-35-83-28-116 5-24 24-34 44-26 20 7 23 28 11 48-14 22-18 53-9 94m-46-90c-20-7-30-23-27-43 21 2 32 17 27 43Zm49-7c-3-20 7-35 27-41 5 21-5 36-27 41Z" fill="#C4A46F" />
              <path d="M140 540c24-23 49-29 74-17m256 16c20-28 45-39 74-32" stroke="#C4D0B8" stroke-width="3" opacity=".7" />
            </g>
            <path d="M74 66h552v540H74z" stroke="#F4F1E8" stroke-width="13" />
            <path d="M98 640h510" stroke="#D9D4C7" stroke-width="2" />
            <path d="M108 626h111m247 0h110" stroke="#A7A08F" stroke-width="2" />
          </svg>
          <div class="art-caption art-caption-bottom">A SMALL PATCH OF WILD</div>
          <span class="sun-stamp">GOOD<br />THINGS<br /><i>grow</i></span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-side-note">A slower kind of green <span>—</span> <span class="side-note-small">made for everyday life</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="intro-band" aria-label="Our belief">
        <span class="section-index">01 / A softer approach</span>
        <p>More than a tidy garden, it’s <em>a place to pause.</em></p>
        <span class="intro-ornament" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
      </section>

      <section class="care-section section-wrap" id="care" aria-labelledby="care-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> What we tend to</p>
            <h2 id="care-title">Care that meets<br />your garden <em>where it is.</em></h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-summary">A few thoughtful touches can bring a little more life to the spaces you already have. Start small; let the garden lead.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-grid">
          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-number">01 <span>—</span> Keep it growing</div>
            <div class="service-doodle doodle-leaf" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 90 90"><path d="M45 78V36m0 26C27 62 17 50 18 31c18 1 28 13 27 31Zm0-19c1-18 13-28 32-27-1 18-13 28-32 27Z"/><path d="M45 78H27"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Seasonal tending</h3>
            <p>Light pruning, clearing and a little attention to the details that help a garden feel cared for.</p>
            <a href="#approach" class="text-link">A considered rhythm <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="service-card service-card-featured">
            <div class="service-number">02 <span>—</span> Make a little room</div>
            <div class="service-doodle doodle-sun" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 90 90"><circle cx="45" cy="45" r="17"/><path d="M45 9v13m0 46v13M9 45h13m46 0h13M19.5 19.5l9.2 9.2m32.6 32.6 9.2 9.2m0-51-9.2 9.2M28.7 61.3l-9.2 9.2"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Planting &amp; refresh</h3>
            <p>Fresh combinations and small changes, shaped around the light, space and character already there.</p>
            <a href="#approach" class="text-link">Grow at your own pace <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-number">03 <span>—</span> Find your footing</div>
            <div class="service-doodle doodle-petal" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 90 90"><path d="M45 78V44m0 19c-14 0-23-8-23-22 14 0 23 8 23 22Zm0-12c0-14 8-23 22-23 0 14-8 23-22 23Zm0-15c-12-8-15-19-8-31 12 8 15 19 8 31Z"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Garden guidance</h3>
            <p>Simple ideas for what to do next, with room to learn and make the space your own.</p>
            <a href="#questions" class="text-link">A few useful answers <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="approach-section" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
        <div class="approach-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 600 620" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="25" y="25" width="550" height="570" rx="275" fill="#D9DECE"/>
            <circle cx="300" cy="288" r="195" stroke="#B5BEA8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M302 479V214m0 163c-89-13-133-67-131-159 89 10 135 65 131 159Zm2-86c7-90 61-134 153-128-7 89-61 135-153 128Z" fill="#788A6C"/>
            <path d="M302 479V245m0 128c-57-10-87-45-89-104 58 8 88 44 89 104Zm5-56c11-57 47-85 106-81-10 58-47 86-106 81Z" fill="#526A52"/>
            <path d="M272 479h62" stroke="#3B4F40" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M101 521c70-29 132-37 201-27 61 9 120 4 193-28" stroke="#A6B198" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 9"/>
            <circle cx="165" cy="157" r="6" fill="#B98C58"/><circle cx="457" cy="412" r="5" fill="#B98C58"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="approach-caption">LET THE GARDEN<br />SET THE PACE</span>
        </div>
        <div class="approach-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> The Fern &amp; Field way</p>
          <h2 id="approach-title">Good gardens<br />begin with <em>noticing.</em></h2>
          <p class="approach-lede">Every patch of green has its own little story. We start by paying attention — to the way the light falls, what’s already thriving and how you want to feel in the space.</p>
          <ol class="steps-list">
            <li><span class="step-no">01</span><div><h3>Take it in</h3><p>Look closely at the space, the season and what matters to you.</p></div></li>
            <li><span class="step-no">02</span><div><h3>Make a gentle plan</h3><p>Choose a few useful next steps, not a whole new garden.</p></div></li>
            <li><span class="step-no">03</span><div><h3>Let it unfold</h3><p>Give good things time to grow, one visit and one season at a time.</p></div></li>
          </ol>
          <button class="button button-disabled" type="button" disabled>Enquiries unavailable in demo</button>
          <p class="demo-explanation">This is a design demo. Enquiries aren’t collected or sent.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="faq-section section-wrap" id="questions" aria-labelledby="questions-title">
        <div class="faq-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> A few things you might wonder</p>
          <h2 id="questions-title">Good to <em>know.</em></h2>
          <p>Every garden is different. Here are a few gentle starting points.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details>
            <summary>Do I need a big garden to begin?<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <p>Not at all. A balcony pot, a small border or a quiet corner can all be a lovely place to start.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What if I’m not sure what my garden needs?<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <p>That’s a perfectly good place to begin. Take a little time to notice what’s growing, where the light lands and what you enjoy about the space.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can I keep things low-maintenance?<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <p>Absolutely. Choose plants that suit your space and the amount of time you have, then let a simple routine do the rest.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Is this a real garden-care business?<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <p>No. Fern &amp; Field is fictional and this page is a design demo only. No services or enquiries are available here.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="closing-note" aria-label="A final thought">
        <span class="closing-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
        <p>Here’s to finding<br />a little more <em>green.</em></p>
        <span class="closing-rule"></span>
        <span class="closing-small">ONE SMALL THING AT A TIME</span>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <a class="footer-brand" href="/demos/fern-and-field/">fern <i>&amp;</i> field <span>✳</span></a>
      <p>Made for a softer kind of everyday.</p>
      <a href="/work/fern-and-field/">Back to the case study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
